*.xml      linguist-detectable
*.json     linguist-detectable
*.jsonc    linguist-detectable
*.jsonl    linguist-detectable

*.md       linguist-detectable -linguist-documentation
/docs      -lingust-documentation

tsconfig.json -linguist-detectable
